<title>USA: Eskimo Pie names David Kewer president/COO.</title>
<headline>Eskimo Pie names David Kewer president/COO.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eskimo Pie Corp said Monday its board had elected David Kewer as president and chief operating officer, effective March 1.</p>
<p>The chief operating officer position is newly created.</p>
<p>Kewer replaces David Clark as president. Clark, formerly chairman, president and chief executive officer, left the firm in September 1996. At that time, Arnold Dreyfus was named chairman and CEO.</p>
<p>Kewer previously was president of Willy Wonka Candy Factory, a subsidiary of Nestle SA's Nestle USA Inc.</p>
</text>
